WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.010
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.380
These are just in the way.

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:04.190
--There it is...
--"Cat Burglar"...

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:08.420
I'm not that great
at the One-Sword Style, but...

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.890
Let's go, Butchie!

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:13.220
Okay! Let's do it, Siam!

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:21.590
<i>Damn it! If I just had another sword!</i>

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:25.740
<i>If I can just get Zoro his swords...</i>

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:32.340
What do you need swords for?

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:42.050
<i>"Luffy, Back in Action!
Miss Kaya's Desperate Resistance"</i>

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:26.430
To think that these brats
have held you back...

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:30.060
How the Black Cat Pirates
have fallen...

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:36.170
Right... Jango?!

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:49.920
B-b-but... you said letting that
kid go wouldn't cause any problems!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.300
Yes, I did say that.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:04:02.570
But so what? We knew he was going
to try to stand up to us.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:05.240
The only thing I didn't count on...

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.510
...was your guys' feebleness!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.150
U-us, feeble?

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:13.150
Who're you calling feeble?!

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:16.140
Watch what you say, Captain Kuro!

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.650
Yeah, you were strong before!

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.820
But that was three years ago!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:28.100
It's not like we partied while you
lived the easy life in this village!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:34.000
'As right! We've attacked lotsa
towns and sunk lotsa pirates!

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.410
Your point being...

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:41.440
You've done nothing for three years!

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:45.240
There's no way you can beat
the Meowban Brothers of today!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.850
S-stop! Butchie! Siam!

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.630
You're not our captain anymore!

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:03.390
Sorry, but we're gonna kill ya!

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:28.190
W-when did he get behind them?!
And those weapons...

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.530
Who...

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:37.000
<i>Who are you going to kill?!</i>

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.300
--He snuck...
--...behind us!

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:45.470
--Eh?!
--He's gone!

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:54.650
There it is! The Pussy Foot Maneuver...

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.640
Pussy Foot Maneuver?

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.890
You're right.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:14.970
I do feel a bit of sluggishness.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.270
<i>He's handling them like kids,</i>

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:20.210
<i>after they had the upper hand
against Zoro and his one sword!</i>

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:26.280
<i>That man's "Pussy Foot Maneuver"
is a silent movement technique.</i>

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:32.420
<i>Even a group of 50 assassins would
be killed before sensing him!</i>

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:37.190
<i>There's no way we can escape his plan!</i>

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:43.760
<i>And I got chills after seeing that
habit of his again three years after!</i>

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:47.200
<i>His odd way of lifting his glasses
to avoid cutting his own face</i>

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.670
<i>with those Cat Claws...</i>

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:52.830
<i>Clear proof that he hasn't
forgotten how to fight!</i>

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:16.160
It seems I've grown
a bit good-natured myself,

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:21.640
during my last three
years on dry land...

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:24.300
I'll give you five minutes.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:30.240
If you can't take care of things
here in five minutes...

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.980
...then I'll kill every
last one of you...

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.980
...with my own two hands!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.100
Five minutes...

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.600
Five minutes should be enough!

00:07:53.600 --> 00:08:00.700
H-him! If we just beat him,
we can get past this hill!

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.950
We had the upper hand
against him just now!

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.520
We'll cut him up in five minutes!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:17.180
We're counting on you,
Meowban Brothers!

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:21.890
Zoro!

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:26.630
What?!

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:31.510
H-hey, you! Now you're
kicking my swords, too?!

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.940
Where's my "thanks"?

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:36.480
Yeah...

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.140
Thanks!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.420
It's no use!
Three swords won't help any!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.580
Your skill's still the same!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.590
Tiger...

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.330
You don't get it, do you...

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.820
...Trap!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.100
Four minutes.

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:09.880
Just having three swords is different

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.540
from knowing the Three Sword Style!

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:23.550
He's strong...

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:29.390
One hit...

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:42.170
H-he beat the Meowban
Brothers in one hit!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.420
Don't worry!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:10:02.120
I'll crush every last one of you
before your five minutes are up!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.010
Three minutes.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:26.480
I- I'll... slaughter him...

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.730
C- Captain...

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.390
H-hypnotize me...

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.970
P-please, Captain!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:43.870
He's alive. You do sloppy work.

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:50.000
His tough fat saved him, huh...

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.590
Get 'im, Butchie!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:20.300
More hypnosis?!

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:28.780
This guy means trouble! He could
already crack the ground apart!

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.850
What happens when he's powered up?!

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.770
This is my chance!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:48.100
I gotta wake him up while I still can!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:53.840
What is that crafty girl up to now?

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:03.210
Everyone's seriously hurt,
and he's just sleeping!

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:07.890
Die!

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.860
Get up!

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:19.860
Nami! Look out!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.000
Two minutes.

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.130
Get up!

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:49.120
Nami! Look out!

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:54.830
Split in two!

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.630
Dodge it!

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:01.130
W-what the?!

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:06.270
<i>A chakram! It wasn't
just a hypnosis tool?!</i>

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:11.740
Nami! How dare you stomp on my face!

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:23.460
H-he's alive?!

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:28.130
Can't tell if he has
bad or good timing...

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.110
L- Luffy...

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:45.890
Luffy!

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:47.910
Oww...

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.760
Ouch!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.130
H-he's alive again!

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:59.570
--This is bad!
--Five minutes is impossible now!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.640
Nami! That hurts, you jerk!

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:04.870
T-that wasn't me!

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.600
It wasn't me-

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:13.580
N- Nami! Did you hurt your shoulder?

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.720
I-it's nothing. I'm fine...

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:23.150
I've done everything I can for now,
so I leave the rest to you...

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:29.330
We absolutely can't afford
to lose this fight...

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:30.560
Yeah!

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.760
For the treasure!

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.640
It'll all work out in the end!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:42.110
Try hard! For my treasure!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.440
Okay! That sounds like you, alright!

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:49.180
One minute.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.150
You can't be serious!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:55.790
<i>Not even Captain Jango and Butchie-san...</i>

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:59.250
...can finish them in one minute!

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:18.080
Butchie! There's no time to think!

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.280
<i>Kill that haramaki bastard!</i>

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:24.810
And I'll handle that weird kid...

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:33.080
I'll kill Straw Hat!

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:42.770
It's about time for everyone to die now.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:59.950
Huh? That bad butler is here too!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:01.720
Isn't he...

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:06.030
Didn't he fall off that cliff and die?

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:08.020
No matter.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.640
Don't approach me...

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:26.840
...from behind!

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:29.680
Kaya!

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.770
<i>U- Usopp-san! Are you okay?!</i>

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:52.340
K- Kaya... What are you doing here?!

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:54.570
<i>I'm so sorry, Usopp-san...</i>

00:16:54.570 --> 00:17:00.010
I know you may not accept my apology,
but I just couldn't believe it...

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.550
K- Klahadore, a pirate...

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:08.220
N-never mind that! Why are you here?!
I- I told you to run away!

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:10.590
Your life is in danger!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:14.250
<i>But you're fighting!</i>

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:21.300
Even after I treated you so horribly
and you've been hurt so much,

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.500
you're still fighting for me! So I...

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.370
Miss Kaya...

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:29.140
Why are you here?

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:34.180
S-stop this...

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:40.880
Stop this, Klahadore!

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:50.760
Merry told me everything.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:58.310
Isn't that the girl from the mansion?

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:01.240
Meaning she's the plan's final target?!

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.980
Then there's no need to
go to the village now?

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.970
We just need to kill her, right?!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:13.750
Klahadore, please! If you want
my fortune, you can have it all!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:18.060
Just please leave this village!
Right now!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.530
I will gladly accept it...

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:27.870
But there's one other
thing I want, you see...

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:33.270
What I want...

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:36.140
...is peace of mind.

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.750
Peace?

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:43.620
Yes. I want simple peace.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:47.620
I find the villagers' trust that
I've fostered these past three years

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:53.130
to be nice and comfortable now.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:59.790
So I want to have that
peace of mind forever...

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.880
And I...

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:15.320
<i>And I will have that peace!
And your fortune...</i>

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.310
<i>In short, pirates will
come to the village!</i>

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:22.260
And...

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.790
...you will leave your will and die!

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:29.830
These two things are absolute.

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:32.830
N-no...

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.800
Y-you're not...

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:36.740
Run!

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:41.070
Run away, Kaya! There's no use
talking to him! Run away!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:47.310
Y-you're not Klahadore.
You're not Klahadore...

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.310
Kaya...

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:55.160
Leave this village!

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:59.330
Oh... You'd point a gun at me...

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:02.300
Leave this minute!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:08.800
I see. You've certainly grown
a lot these past three years...

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.870
...Miss Kaya.

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:18.310
Do you remember? So much has
happened in three years...

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:20.310
We spent so much time together,

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:27.420
even before your parents passed
away and you became bedridden...

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:29.410
So much time...

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:34.130
So many memories...

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:39.130
Together we suffered,
together we rejoiced...

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:42.640
K- Klahadore...

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:45.440
I would visit the city with you,

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:49.210
and whenever you had a fever,
I constantly looked after you...

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:55.380
You listened to my stories so happily...

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:59.590
I devoted myself to you...

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:01.320
For so long...

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:06.320
Yes, for so long, I endured it...

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:15.160
Yes, it was all so that
I could kill you today...

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:25.950
I, a man once know as Captain Kuro,

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:31.050
had to smile humbly
for some snot-nosed girl...

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:35.280
I went against my nature
and sucked up to you...

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.030
Damn you...

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:46.330
Do you understand these daily insults?!

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:51.670
Do you understand this man once
known as Captain Kuro?!

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:01.840
Kuro!

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:10.650
Come to think of it...

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:16.530
...I still owe you for hitting me...

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:18.400
<i>Usopp-san!</i>

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:23.390
You hit me with all your
might, as I recall...

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:53.030
<i>If you hate getting hit that much,
I got a hundred more punches for you!</i>

00:22:56.100 --> 00:23:06.100
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:37.070
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:45.550
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:52.630
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.630 --> 00:24:02.620
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
